#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:9
msgid "Obtain the exact source and pinned dependencies"
msgstr "取得精确源码与锁定依赖"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:11
msgid ""
"Use this guide before running repository commands in a tutorial, "
"configuration reference or maintenance workflow. You will obtain a detached, "
"exact Nexus source revision and its reviewed dependency closure. This "
"requires Git, Python 3.11+ and network access for the initial clone and "
"dependency retrieval. It does not build, flash or establish software or "
"hardware qualification."
msgstr ""
"在执行教程、配置参考或维护工作流中的仓库命令前，先使用本指南。你将取得处于 detached 状态的精确 Nexus "
"源码版本及经过审查的依赖闭包。首次克隆和取得依赖需要 Git、Python 3.11+ 及网络访问。本流程不构建、不刷写，也不建立软件或硬件资格。"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:17
msgid "Select the revision described by your documentation"
msgstr "选择当前文档描述的版本"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:19
msgid ""
"Open the immutable documentation version identified by the page's version "
"banner. Download `documentation-manifest.json` from that version's root, or "
"use the file already present at the root of its verified offline package. "
"Keep it outside your future checkout, for example as `nexus-documentation-"
"manifest.json` in your working parent directory. If you entered through "
"`stable/`, record the resolved immutable version before downloading; do not "
"mix two versions."
msgstr ""
"打开页面版本横幅标识的不可变文档版本。从该版本根目录下载 `documentation-"
"manifest.json`，或使用已验证离线包根目录中的同名文件。将其保存在即将创建的 checkout 外，例如工作父目录下的 `nexus-"
"documentation-manifest.json`。如果从 `stable/` 进入，先记录其选择的不可变版本，再下载；不得混用两个版本。"

