msgstr "`code_source.commit`"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "Source described by the package; inspect its identity separately"
msgstr "文档包描述的源码；应单独核对其身份"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid "`qualification_references[]`"
msgstr "`qualification_references[]`"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:0
msgid ""
"Explicitly verified candidate references in a schema 2 package, each with its"
" original source and scope; may be empty"
msgstr "schema 2 包中显式验证的候选引用，各自保留原源码和范围；可以为空"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:32
msgid ""
"Historical schema 1 packages retain their original `qualified_code.commit` "
"field for read-only recovery. Do not interpret it as a current schema 2 "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"历史 schema 1 包保留原始 `qualified_code.commit` 字段，用于只读恢复。不得将其解释为当前 schema 2 引用。"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:35
msgid ""
"The default GitHub branch may lag a reviewed documentation branch. A branch "
"name, successful clone or documentation release is not a substitute for the "
"exact commit. The previously reviewed documentation snapshot is "
"`5a7a75c321ea173df8692714f95a8df13715293d`; choosing it recreates that "
"snapshot, not later documentation. Its [immutable package "
"manifest](https://x-gen-"
"lab.github.io/nexus/versions/docs-20261014-5a7a75c321ea/documentation-"
"manifest.json) is one concrete example. Use your version's manifest for the "
"current tutorial."
msgstr ""
"GitHub 默认分支可能落后于已审查的文档分支。分支名、成功克隆或文档发行都不能替代精确提交。此前已审查的文档快照是 "
"`5a7a75c321ea173df8692714f95a8df13715293d`；选择它只能重建该快照，不能取得后续文档。它的[不可变包清单](https://x-gen-"
"lab.github.io/nexus/versions/docs-20261014-5a7a75c321ea/documentation-"
"manifest.json)是一个具体例子。执行当前教程时，使用你所读版本自己的清单。"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:42
msgid "Clone and initialize that exact revision"
msgstr "克隆并初始化该精确版本"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:44
msgid ""
"Run these POSIX-shell commands from the parent directory containing the "
"downloaded manifest. Choose a new checkout directory; the commands do not "
"replace one that already exists. The Python command validates the identity "
"before passing it to Git:"
msgstr ""
"从保存已下载清单的父目录执行以下 POSIX shell 命令。选择新的 checkout 目录；命令不会替换已有目录。Python "
"命令先验证身份，再将其传给 Git："

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:62
msgid ""
"Check every command's exit status. `git rev-parse HEAD` must equal the "
"manifest's full commit. Recursive submodule lines must have neither a leading"
" `-` (missing), `+` (different revision) nor `U` (conflict), and `git status "
"--short` must be empty before starting a clean-source workflow. Stop on an "
"unavailable commit or failed dependency retrieval; never substitute `main`, "
"`HEAD` or a latest dependency. The preparation command audits the source-"
"owned catalogue and each parent Gitlink before initializing its explicitly "
"selected paths. Firmware configuration does not retrieve dependencies. For "
"historical revisions predating this command, use the matching immutable "
"documentation rather than applying current commands to an older source tree. "
"For a preview without a package manifest, record the full commit from its "
"source banner or `documentation-build.json` and use that validated commit "
"explicitly."
msgstr ""
"检查每条命令的退出状态。`git rev-parse HEAD` 必须与清单中的完整提交一致。递归子模块状态输出不能以 "
"`-`（缺失）、`+`（版本不同）或 `U`（冲突）开头；开始干净源码工作流前，`git status --short` "
"必须为空。提交不可取得或依赖取得失败时立即停止，绝不能替换为 `main`、`HEAD` "
"或最新依赖。准备命令在初始化显式选中的路径前，会审查源码维护的依赖清单和各父模块的 "
"Gitlink。固件配置过程不会取得依赖。对于本命令引入之前的历史版本，请使用与其对应的不可变文档，不要把当前命令用于旧源码树。没有包清单的预览应从源码横幅或"
" `documentation-build.json` 记录完整提交，并显式使用该已验证提交。"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:75
msgid ""
"Fetching the exact source commit avoids downloading unrelated artifact "
"branches. The `documentation-assets` branch holds large historical evidence "
"archives; it is not a source dependency. Retrieve only an archive identified "
"by the [software evidence entry](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/status/software-"
"verification.md) when you need its original raw evidence. A verified Source "
"SDK is another supported consumption path; it does not require the source "
"repository's artifact history."
msgstr ""
"取得精确源码提交可避免下载无关产物分支。`documentation-assets` "
"分支保存大型历史证据归档，不是源码依赖。仅在需要原始证据时，获取[软件证据入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/status/software-"
"verification.md)明确标识的归档。经过验证的 Source SDK 是另一条受维护消费路径，不需要源码仓库的产物历史。"

#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:82
msgid ""
"On Windows, run the POSIX snippet in Git Bash, or read the same manifest "
"field and perform the corresponding Git commands in your shell. Do not treat "
"the shell variable syntax as a portable PowerShell command."
msgstr ""
"Windows 下可在 Git Bash 中执行这段 POSIX 命令，或读取同一清单字段，在自己的 shell 中执行对应 Git "
"命令。不要将这里的变量语法直接当作可移植的 PowerShell 命令。"

