#: docs/guides/source-checkout.md:96
msgid ""
"Each tutorial starts from the repository root established above. Keep "
"independent consumer and package outputs outside the source checkout when "
"instructed. Retain manifests, source identities and required reports before "
"deleting only directories you created. A clean checkout supplies input "
"identity; actual execution and [qualification "
"evidence](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/status/software-"
"verification.md) remain separate."
msgstr ""
"每个教程均从上面确定的仓库根开始。按说明将独立消费者和打包输出放在源码 checkout 外。删除自己创建的目录前，保留 "
"manifest、源码身份和必要报告。干净 checkout 提供输入身份；实际执行与[资格证据](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/status/software-"
"verification.md)仍然独立。"
